  "description": "RIDE EASY. LIVE URBAN. While the Macina Urbanator SX embodies a sporty urban lifestyle, the Macina Superbelt SX is designed for riders who prefer a more relaxed approach to city riding. Comfort, lightness, and an effortless riding experience take center stage, making it the ideal companion for daily commutes, relaxed evening rides, and weekend getaways. Thanks to its belt drive and hub gearing, the Superbelt SX delivers low-maintenance riding enjoyment. Clean, quiet, durable, and highly resistant to dirt, the system is designed to keep you moving with minimal effort. At the top of the range, the Superbelt SX 10 Di2 takes comfort to the next level with its Shimano Alfine Di2 hub gear and automatic shifting function, delivering an exceptionally smooth and intuitive riding experience. Like all SX models, the Superbelt SX features KTM’s innovative POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system for user-friendly battery handling. The CompactTube 400 Wh battery can be removed upwards from the frame on all models, making battery removal and installation quick and convenient. This simple process also makes it easy to carry a second battery for extended rides. For even greater range, the Bosch PowerMore Range Extender with 250 Wh is available. On the diamond and trapeze frame versions of the SX models, it can be mounted directly to the battery cover, providing additional energy whenever longer distances call for it.",
